\exercise{Exercise 1 -- Correlation and least-squares line}
FERSET observes annual customer numbers $x$ (hundreds) and revenue $y$ (in $10^4$ euros):

\begin{center}\small
\begin{tabular}{c|rrrrrrrrrr}
Year&2005&2006&2007&2008&2009&2010&2011&2012&2013&2014\\\hline
$x$ (hundreds of customers)&5&6&7&9&8&11&12&13&14&16\\
